         B-70:30                            3.426                   1.713

         B-80:20                            2.284                   1.142

         B-90:10                            1.142                     571

         C-60:40                            6.357                   3.029

         C-70:30                            4.613                   2.382

         C-80:20                            2.616                   1.502

         C-90:10                            1.062                     771

         D-60:40                            6.357                   3.029

